div slot="handle" class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white"><svg width="24" height="24" fill="black" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17.664 17.823V6.177c0-1.843-2.15-2.85-3.565-1.668l-6.982 5.826a2.173 2.173 0 0 0 0 3.337l6.983 5.82c1.415 1.18 3.564.173 3.564-1.67"></path></svg><svg width="24" height="24" fill="black" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6.336 6.177v11.646c0 1.843 2.15 2.85 3.565 1.668l6.982-5.826a2.173 2.173 0 0 0-.001-3.337L9.9 4.508c-1.415-1.18-3.564-.173-3.564 1.67"></path></svg></div></img-comparison-slider></div></div></div></div></div><div class="landing-section-wrapper bg-background" style="content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 500px"><hr class="w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14" data-testid="divider"></div><div class="landing-section-wrapper bg-background" style="content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 500px"><div class="relative bg-background flex flex-1 min-h-[210px] z-[2]" data-testid="banner-block" data-pulse-section-group="-ai-image-enhancer-unpixelate-image-_banner-block" id="11_132690_banner-block"><div class="container-root grid items-center gap-16 grid-cols-[7fr_5fr] max-md:mt-10 max-md:flex max-md:!flex-col-reverse max-md:gap-8" data-testid="container"><div class="z-[2] flex flex-1 flex-col gap-6 max-md:items-center" data-testid="banner-block-copy"><h2 id="212650" class="text-[42px] leading-[50px] font-semibold max-[768px]:text-[32px] max-[768px]:leading-[40px] break-words text-light max-md:text-center" data-testid="heading-title"><span>Unpixelate Images in batch</span></h2><div class="Description-description-f9d64 Description-sizeLarge-4f730 max-md:text-center font-medium text-light [&amp;_ul]:my-4 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-6 [&amp;_li]:pl-2 [&amp;_li::marker]:text-accent-pink" data-testid="description-root"><p>Got a ton of old, pixelated family photos that you want to restore? Depixelate up to 50 of them easily with Picsart's <a href="https://picsart.com/batch-photo-editor/" rel="noopener">Batch Editor</a>. Simply upload your photos and let AI do its thing. It'll detect pixelated parts, reduce blurring, touch up details, and deliver your unpixelated image files!</p></div></div><div class="z-[1] flex w-full justify-end max-md:!justify-center max-md:!order-none" data-testid="media-root"><div class="relative w-[480px] aspect-square overflow-hidden max-[1365px]:max-w-[447px] max-[1279px]:max-w-[340px] max-[1023px]:max-w-[243px] max-[767px]:max-w-[424px] max-[767px]:mt-10 max-[480px]:max-w-[319px] "><video src="https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/62bff16b-ce11-4378-832c-3cdf56a4e93b.webm" autoplay="" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" poster="https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/8ca18ff0-de69-4a65-a1da-2bb0f512b03c.webp" class="h-full w-full object-contain "></video></div></div></div></div></div><div class="landing-section-wrapper bg-background" style="content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 500px"><hr class="w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14" data-testid="divider"></div><div class="landing-section-wrapper bg-background" style="content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 500px"><div class="relative bg-background flex flex-1 min-h-[210px] z-[2]" data-testid="banner-block" data-pulse-section-group="-ai-image-enhancer-unpixelate-image-_banner-block" id="13_132691_banner-block"><div class="container-root grid items-center gap-16 grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] max-md:mt-10 max-md:flex max-md:!flex-col-reverse max-md:gap-8" data-testid="container"><div class="z-[2] flex flex-1 flex-col gap-6 max-md:items-center" data-testid="banner-block-copy"><h2 id="212651" class="text-[42px] leading-[50px] font-semibold max-[768px]:text-[32px] max-[768px]:leading-[40px] break-words text-light max-md:text-center" data-testid="heading-title"><span>Remove pixelation&nbsp;for e-commerce storefronts</span></h2><div class="Description-description-f9d64 Description-sizeLarge-4f730 max-md:text-center font-medium text-light [&amp;_ul]:my-4 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-6 [&amp;_li]:pl-2 [&amp;_li::marker]:text-accent-pink" data-testid="description-root"><p>Enhance your e-commerce presence by unpixelating product photos with the image depixelizer tool, ideal for online stores, catalogs, and marketing material. Ensure a sharp product presentation and give your online storefront a professional look. Create striking before-and-after photos that bring your products and services to center stage.&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="z-[1] flex w-full justify-start order-first max-md:!justify-center max-md:!order-none" data-testid="media-root"><div class="relative w-[480px] aspect-square overflow-hidden max-[1365px]:max-w-[447px] max-[1279px]:max-w-[340px] max-[1023px]:max-w-[243px] max-[767px]:max-w-[424px] max-[767px]:mt-10 max-[480px]:max-w-[319px] rounded-3xl "><img-comparison-slider class="max-h-full max-w-full [--divider-width:2px] focus:outline-none rendered" tabindex="0"><template shadowrootmode="open"><div class="second" id="second"> <slot name="second"><slot name="before"></slot></slot> </div> <div class="first horizontal" id="first" style="--exposure: 50%;"> <div class="first-overlay"> <div class="first-overlay-container" id="firstImageContainer"> <slot name="first"><slot name="after"></slot></slot> </div> </div> <div class="handle-container"> <div class="divider"></div> <div class="handle" id="handle"> <slot name="handle"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="default-handle" viewBox="-8 -3 16 6"> <path d="M -5 -2 L -7 0 L -5 2 M 5 -2 L 7 0 L 5 2" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></path> </svg> </slot> </div> </div> </div> </template><picture slot="first" class="max-h-full max-w-full"><img alt="before change" fetchpriority="low" loading="lazy" width="480" height="480" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-h-full max-w-full" style="color:transparent" srcset="/landings-ssr/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com%2Fcms-uploads%2F588451d9-1bdb-4838-9c80-b1da436144bd.webp&amp;w=512&amp;q=75 1x, /landings-ssr/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com%2Fcms-uploads%2F588451d9-1bdb-4838-9c80-b1da436144bd.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="./coffee_files/588451d9-1bdb-4838-9c80-b1da436144bd.avif"></picture><picture slot="second" class="max-h-full max-w-full"><img alt="after change" fetchpriority="low" loading="lazy" width="480" height="480" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-h-full max-w-full" style="color:transparent" srcset="/landings-ssr/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com%2Fcms-uploads%2F8fb17729-3403-4a90-af1f-18c3f28a4b0f.webp&amp;w=512&amp;q=75 1x, /landings-ssr/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com%2Fcms-uploads%2F8fb17729-3403-4a90-af1f-18c3f28a4b0f.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="./coffee_files/8fb17729-3403-4a90-af1f-18c3f28a4b0f.avif"></picture><div slot="handle" class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white"><svg width="24" height="24" fill="black" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17.664 17.823V6.177c0-1.843-2.15-2.85-3.565-1.668l-6.982 5.826a2.173 2.173 0 0 0 0 3.337l6.983 5.82c1.415 1.18 3.564.173 3.564-1.67"></path></svg><svg width="24" height="24" fill="black" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6.336 6.177v11.646c0 1.843 2.15 2.85 3.565 1.668l6.982-5.826a2.173 2.173 0 0 0-.001-3.337L9.9 4.508c-1.415-1.18-3.564-.173-3.564 1.67"></path></svg></div></img-comparison-slider></div></div></div></div></div><div class="landing-section-wrapper bg-background" style="content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 500px"><hr class="w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14" data-testid="divider"></div><div class="landing-section-wrapper bg-background" style="content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 500px"><div class="relative bg-background flex flex-1 min-h-[210px] z-[2]" data-testid="banner-block" data-pulse-section-group="-ai-image-enhancer-unpixelate-image-_banner-block" id="15_132692_banner-block"><div class="container-root grid items-center gap-16 grid-cols-[7fr_5fr] max-md:mt-10 max-md:flex max-md:!flex-col-reverse max-md:gap-8" data-testid="container"><div class="z-[2] flex flex-1 flex-col gap-6 max-md:items-center" data-testid="banner-block-copy"><h2 id="212652" class="text-[42px] leading-[50px] font-semibold max-[768px]:text-[32px] max-[768px]:leading-[40px] break-words text-light max-md:text-center" data-testid="heading-title"><span>Unpixelate Images for social media</span></h2><div class="Description-description-f9d64 Description-sizeLarge-4f730 max-md:text-center font-medium text-light [&amp;_ul]:my-4 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-6 [&amp;_li]:pl-2 [&amp;_li::marker]:text-accent-pink" data-testid="description-root"><p>Kick your social media presence up a notch with Picsart's depixelating tool. Raise the bar with first-rate posts, ads, and presentations. Remove pixelation in any image and get it ready for large-format advertising - without losing an inch of quality. Maximize the impact of your visuals with images that are crisp, clear, and unpixelated.&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="z-[1] flex w-full justify-end max-md:!justify-center max-md:!order-none" data-testid="media-root"><div class="relative w-[480px] aspect-square overflow-hidden max-[1365px]:max-w-[447px] max-[1279px]:max-w-[340px] max-[1023px]:max-w-[243px] max-[767px]:max-w-[424px] max-[767px]:mt-10 max-[480px]:max-w-[319px] rounded-3xl "><img-comparison-slider class="max-h-full max-w-full [--divider-width:2px] focus:outline-none rendered" tabindex="0"><template shadowrootmode="open"><div class="second" id="second"> <slot name="second"><slot name="before"></slot></slot> </div> <div class="first horizontal" id="first" style="--exposure: 50%;"> <div class="first-overlay"> <div class="fi