3.org/2000/svg" class="quote-icon mb-6 block w-9 h-9 [&amp;&gt;path]:fill-[var(--primary-colors-base-default)]"><path d="M21.99 2.66a.74.74 0 0 1-.143.576.88.88 0 0 1-.506.313q-2.21.36-3.46 1.08-1.249.698-1.896 1.754a6.7 6.7 0 0 0-.673 1.538q-.26.947-.36 1.923.48-.314 1.008-.482a4 4 0 0 1 1.153-.167h1.034q1.585 0 2.714 1.129 1.129 1.106 1.13 2.715v5.117q0 1.586-1.13 2.714Q19.73 22 18.146 22h-1.033q-1.585 0-2.713-1.13-1.13-1.129-1.13-2.714v-5.117q0-2.308.264-4.18.288-1.876 1.13-3.268a6.46 6.46 0 0 1 2.475-2.306q1.56-.864 3.964-1.273a.7.7 0 0 1 .551.143.84.84 0 0 1 .335.505m-11.304.3a.7.7 0 0 0 .012-.303.74.74 0 0 0-.312-.505.74.74 0 0 0-.577-.143q-2.379.41-3.964 1.273a6.3 6.3 0 0 0-2.451 2.306q-.864 1.393-1.129 3.268Q2 10.731 2 13.036v5.117q0 1.586 1.13 2.714 1.129 1.13 2.714 1.13h1.033q1.586 0 2.714-1.13 1.13-1.129 1.13-2.714v-5.117q0-1.609-1.13-2.715-1.129-1.129-2.714-1.129H5.844q-.6 0-1.153.167a3.7 3.7 0 0 0-1.009.482q.1-.976.36-1.923.24-.864.672-1.538.625-1.056 1.875-1.753 1.249-.722 3.483-1.08a.78.78 0 0 0 .481-.314.8.8 0 0 0 .131-.273z"></path></svg><div class="relative flex items-center h-inherit text-base leading-6 font-normal"><span class="pb-14 mb-14"><div class="Description-description-f9d64 Description-sizeSmall-012c9 text-light" data-testid="description-root">Perfect for social posts! I use Picsart to clean up my content before posting, and the unpixelate feature is magic. Every image looks crisp and polished - no more fuzzy photos on my feed.</div></span></div><span class="absolute bottom-[30px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mb-4 text-xl font-semibold leading-7 inline-block"><div class="Description-description-f9d64 Description-sizeLarge-4f730 text-light" data-testid="description-root">Leo A., Content creator</div></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="landing-section-wrapper bg-background" style="content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 500px"><hr class="w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14" data-testid="divider"></div><div class="landing-section-wrapper bg-background" style="content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 500px"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is unpixelation or depixelation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>By unpixelation or depixelation, we refer to the process of putting pixelated images back together and restoring them. Images can get pixelated for different reasons, whether intentional or unintentional.&nbsp;</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How to unpixelate a picture?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>The easiest way to unpixelate image files is using a tool like Picsart’s picture pixel remover. It’s AI-based, efficient, and saves time.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does it take to unpixelate a picture with Picsart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>It takes a matter of seconds to unpixelate photos with Picsart. Exact times can vary depending on your internet speed.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I unpixelate multiple images at once?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Yes. Picsart’s tool can depixelate image batches that include up to 50 images.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the image depixelizer easy to use?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Picsart’s tool allows you to unpixelate a picture with just 1 click through a user-friendly interface. It’s fast and easy to use.</p>"}}]}</script><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[642px] max-md:px-3" data-testid="faq-section" data-pulse-section-group="21_17943_faq"><h2 class="text-[42px] leading-[50px] font-semibold max-[768px]:text-[32px] max-[768px]:leading-[40px] text-light max-[767px]:text-[28px] max-[767px]:leading-9 text-center pb-[16px]" data-testid="heading-title"><span>Pixel remover FAQ</span></h2><div><div id="what-is-unpixelation-or-depixelation" class="border-b border-[var(--background-colors-border)] py-6"><button id="what-is-unpixelation-or-depixelation-button" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="what-is-unpixelation-or-depixelation-answer" class="flex w-full cursor-pointer text-light items-center justify-between border-none bg-transparent pb-0 text-left text-base font-semibold leading-6" data-testid="what-is-unpixelation-or-depixelation"><span class="pr-4"><h3 class="text-[42px] leading-[50px] font-semibold max-[768px]:text-[32px] max-[768px]:leading-[40px] text-[16px]! leading-[22px]!" data-testid="heading-title"><span>What is unpixelation or depixelation?</span></h3></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 min-w-[40px] max-w-[40px] shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--positive-colors-base-default)] shadow-[0px_0px_16px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.24)] ml-6 transition-transform duration-300 rotate-180"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span></button><div id="what-is-unpixelation-or-depixelation-answer" role="region" aria-labelledby="what-is-unpixelation-or-depixelation-button" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="text-base font-medium leading-6 text-foreground max-w-[578px]"><div class="Description-description-f9d64 Description-weightMedium-b5588 mx-auto max-w-[1072px] text-light leading-[18.5px] font-[&#39;Picsart-Fonts&#39;]" data-testid="description-root"><p>By unpixelation or depixelation, we refer to the process of putting pixelated images back together and restoring them. Images can get pixelated for different reasons, whether intentional or unintentional.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id="how-to-unpixelate-a-picture" class="border-b border-[var(--background-colors-border)] py-6"><button id="how-to-unpixelate-a-picture-button" type="button" aria-expand