ion\":{\"id\":157122,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eRemove pixels from image files and uncover the hidden details in your photos in an instant! Use Picsart's picture pixel remover to\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"https://picsart.com/ai-image-enhancer/\\\"\u003eenhance photo quality\u003c/a\u003e and give your images new life with little to no effort on your end.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"size\":\"large\",\"fontWeight\":\"Regular\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/descriptionSection\",\"cmsId\":157122},\"media\":{\"id\":147712,\"imageSrc\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/3250c539-03d7-4edb-b823-5b8ec6800f2a.webp\",\"alt\":\"fix pixelated images\",\"padding\":\"none\",\"objectFit\":\"Contain\",\"isLazy\":true,\"imageForSlider\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/b210291f-08a3-4fea-97fa-c5f9fb45f916.webp\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/media\",\"cmsId\":147712},\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block\",\"cmsId\":132688,\"index\":7,\"pageLocale\":\"en\",\"priority\":false,\"headingTag\":\"h2\"}]}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Divider-89953-8\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14\",\"data-testid\":\"divider\"}]}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"BannerBlock-132689-9\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"id\":132689,\"colorScheme\":\"light\",\"layout\":\"Copy 42% / Media 58%\",\"layoutOrder\":\"Media | Copy\",\"titleSection\":{\"id\":212649,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eEnhance, restore and Unpixelate Images with AI\u003c/p\u003e\",\"tag\":\"h2\",\"size\":\"extra-large\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/titleSection\",\"cmsId\":212649},\"descriptionSection\":{\"id\":157123,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003ePicsart's AI-powered image depixelizer lets you improve resolution,\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"https://picsart.com/ai-image-enhancer/sharpen-image/\\\"\u003esharpen images\u003c/a\u003e, and enhance the overall quality of your photos. The intuitive, fast-processing AI can detect and remove pixels from image files automatically.\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"https://picsart.com/ai-image-enhancer/unblur/\\\"\u003eUnblur images\u003c/a\u003e and\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"https://picsart.com/ai-image-enhancer/photo-restoration/\\\"\u003erestore old family photos\u003c/a\u003e to relive your precious memories as if they were taken just yesterday.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"size\":\"large\",\"fontWeight\":\"Regular\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/descriptionSection\",\"cmsId\":157123},\"media\":{\"id\":147713,\"imageSrc\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/8a368710-39bb-483b-8917-bd89ccfdfd9a.webp\",\"alt\":\"unpixelate images online\",\"padding\":\"none\",\"objectFit\":\"Contain\",\"isLazy\":true,\"imageForSlider\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/d334ce6e-b4ee-4897-8d4e-d2048716ba08.webp\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/media\",\"cmsId\":147713},\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block\",\"cmsId\":132689,\"index\":9,\"pageLocale\":\"en\",\"priority\":false,\"headingTag\":\"h2\"}]}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Divider-89954-10\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14\",\"data-testid\":\"divider\"}]}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"BannerBlock-132690-11\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"id\":132690,\"colorScheme\":\"light\",\"layout\":\"Copy 42% / Media 58%\",\"layoutOrder\":\"Copy | Media\",\"titleSection\":{\"id\":212650,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eUnpixelate Images in batch\u003c/p\u003e\",\"tag\":\"h2\",\"size\":\"extra-large\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/titleSection\",\"cmsId\":212650},\"descriptionSection\":{\"id\":157124,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eGot a ton of old, pixelated family photos that you want to restore? Depixelate up to 50 of them easily with Picsart's \u003ca href=\\\"https://picsart.com/batch-photo-editor/\\\"\u003eBatch Editor\u003c/a\u003e. Simply upload your photos and let AI do its thing. It'll detect pixelated parts, reduce blurring, touch up details, and deliver your unpixelated image files!\u003c/p\u003e\",\"size\":\"large\",\"fontWeight\":\"Regular\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/descriptionSection\",\"cmsId\":157124},\"media\":{\"id\":147714,\"imageSrc\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/8ca18ff0-de69-4a65-a1da-2bb0f512b03c.webp\",\"alt\":\"unpixelate Images in batch\",\"videoSrc\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/62bff16b-ce11-4378-832c-3cdf56a4e93b.webm\",\"padding\":\"none\",\"objectFit\":\"Contain\",\"isLazy\":true,\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/media\",\"cmsId\":147714},\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block\",\"cmsId\":132690,\"index\":11,\"pageLocale\":\"en\",\"priority\":false,\"headingTag\":\"h2\"}]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Divider-89955-12\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14\",\"data-testid\":\"divider\"}]}]\n71:[\"$\",\"div\",\"BannerBlock-132691-13\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"id\":132691,\"colorScheme\":\"light\",\"layout\":\"Copy 42% / Media 58%\",\"layoutOrder\":\"Media | Copy\",\"titleSection\":{\"id\":212651,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eRemove pixelation\u0026nbsp;for e-commerce storefronts\u003c/p\u003e\",\"tag\":\"h2\",\"size\":\"extra-large\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/titleSection\",\"cmsId\":212651},\"descriptionSection\":{\"id\":157125,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eEnhance your e-commerce presence by unpixelating product photos with the image depixelizer tool, ideal for online stores, catalogs, and marketing material. Ensure a sharp product presentation and give your online storefront a professional look. Create striking before-and-after photos that bring your products and services to center stage.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\",\"size\":\"large\",\"fontWeight\":\"Regular\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/descriptionSection\",\"cmsId\":157125},\"media\":{\"id\":147715,\"imageSrc\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/588451d9-1bdb-4838-9c80-b1da436144bd.webp\",\"alt\":\"remove photo pixelation\",\"padding\":\"none\",\"objectFit\":\"Contain\",\"isLazy\":true,\"imageForSlider\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/8fb17729-3403-4a90-af1f-18c3f28a4b0f.webp\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/media\",\"cmsId\":147715},\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block\",\"cmsId\":132691,\"index\":13,\"pageLocale\":\"en\",\"priority\":false,\"headingTag\":\"h2\"}]}]\n72:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Divider-89956-14\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14\",\"data-testid\":\"divider\"}]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"div\",\"BannerBlock-132692-15\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"id\":132692,\"colorScheme\":\"light\",\"layout\":\"Copy 42% / Media 58%\",\"layoutOrder\":\"Copy | Media\",\"titleSection\":{\"id\":212652,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eUnpixelate Images for social media\u003c/p\u003e\",\"tag\":\"h2\",\"size\":\"extra-large\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/titleSection\",\"cmsId\":212652},\"descriptionSection\":{\"id\":157126,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eKick your social media presence up a notch with Picsart's depixelating tool. Raise the bar with first-rate posts, ads, and presentations. Remove pixelation in any image and get it ready for large-format advertising - without losing an inch of quality. Maximize the impact of your visuals with images that are crisp, clear, and unpixelated.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\",\"size\":\"large\",\"fontWeight\":\"Regular\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/descriptionSection\",\"cmsId\":157126},\"media\":{\"id\":147716,\"imageSrc\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/bb24fe29-18e8-4701-a924-84cfc68ef38b.webp\",\"alt\":\"unpixelate images for social media channels\",\"padding\":\"none\",\"objectFit\":\"Contain\",\"isLazy\":true,\"imageForSlider\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/227789bc-340b-466d-a70c-31b4e9e3171a.webp\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/media\",\"cmsId\":147716},\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block\",\"cmsId\":132692,\"index\":15,\"pageLocale\":\"en\",\"priority\":false,\"headingTag\":\"h2\"}]}]\n74:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Divider-89957-16\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14\",\"data-testid\":\"divider\"}]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"div\",\"BannerBlock-132693-17\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L64\",null,{\"id\":132693,\"colorScheme\":\"light\",\"layout\":\"Copy 42% / Media 58%\",\"layoutOrder\":\"Media | Copy\",\"titleSection\":{\"id\":212653,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eKeep finessing with Picsart’s AI photo editor\u003c/p\u003e\",\"tag\":\"h2\",\"size\":\"extra-large\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/titleSection\",\"cmsId\":212653},\"descriptionSection\":{\"id\":157127,\"text\":\"\u003cp\u003eAccess an all-inclusive set of tools with Picsart’s\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"https://picsart.com/ai-photo-editor/\\\"\u003eAI photo editor\u003c/a\u003e. Conveniently perform easy tweaks like\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"https://picsart.com/flip-image/\\\"\u003eflipping images\u003c/a\u003e, to more complex edits like expanding your image beyond its original borders with the\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"https://picsart.com/ai-image-extender/\\\"\u003eimage extender\u003c/a\u003e tool. All this and so much more, available to you in a convenient online interface that doesn’t require any downloads.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\",\"size\":\"large\",\"fontWeight\":\"Regular\",\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/descriptionSection\",\"cmsId\":157127},\"media\":{\"id\":147717,\"imageSrc\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/78794ffc-69d6-4517-b2d1-a89f65d46135.webp\",\"alt\":\"image photo editing\",\"videoSrc\":\"https://cdn-cms-uploads.picsart.com/cms-uploads/f183d289-447d-46c5-a2ca-7b5c40304c0c.webm\",\"padding\":\"none\",\"objectFit\":\"Contain\",\"isLazy\":true,\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block/media\",\"cmsId\":147717},\"cmsName\":\"redesigned.banner-block\",\"cmsId\":132693,\"index\":17,\"pageLocale\":\"en\",\"priority\":false,\"headingTag\":\"h2\"}]}]\n76:[\"$\",\"div\",\"Divider-89958-18\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full border-0 bg-background h-8 md:h-14\",\"data-testid\":\"divider\"}]}]\n77:[\"$\",\"div\",\"TestimonialWithCardDesignAndTitle-5085-19\",{\"className\":\"landing-section-wrapper bg-background\",\"style\":{\"contentVisibility\":\"auto\",\"containIntrinsicSize\":\"auto 500px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L89\",null,{\"id\":5085,\"colorScheme\":\"light\",\"cards\":\"$6:0:pro